    {
        "id": "64dd58ba128e818f",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "8f708038682bad2f",
        "name": "Buzzer?",
        "info": "There are multiple buzzers coded.\n\nbuzzerPulse: Pulses the buzzer, may not be used at all (maybe if the servo detects it being close?)\n\nbuzzerLong: Will beep it if the wrong code is inputted\n\nbuzzerBuzz: constant, for when the DOOR or WINDOW is opened while ARMED\n\nbuzzerOff: turns the buzzer off ",
        "x": 980,
        "y": 480,
        "wires": []
    },
    {
